START APPLICATION
       ↓
CONNECT ALL FOUR SENSORS
       ↓
VERIFY AND CALIBRATE SENSORS
       ↓
USER PRESSES START MOVEMENT
       ↓
BEGIN TRACKING ALL SENSOR DATA
       ↓
DETECT NEGATIVE ROTATIONAL DRIFT
       ↓
DETECT FORWARD ROTATION
       ↓
CALCULATE TORSO-TO-PELVIS SEPARATION
       ↓
IDENTIFY MAXIMUM SEPARATION
       ↓
TRACK ROTATIONAL CLOSURE RATE
       ↓
USER PRESSES STOP MOVEMENT
       ↓
PROCESS AND CALCULATE PEAK DATA
       ↓
DISPLAY RESULTS AND GRAPHS
       ↓
SAVE OR COMPARE RECORDING
       ↓
END
